@startuml
title P2 codec/player spike proof flow
autonumber

actor Researcher
participant "Fixture corpus" as Fixtures
participant "Range harness\nstream_variants" as Harness
participant "Bundled candidate" as Bundled
participant "MF + native macOS" as Native
participant "Pure-Go candidate" as PureGo
participant "Current node scheduler\nready/resume_at" as Scheduler
participant "Metrics collector" as Metrics
participant "Manual hardware epic" as Manual

Researcher -> Fixtures: Select 2h MP3/AAC/Opus case
Researcher -> Harness: Publish variant + auth token
Bundled -> Metrics: Import signed package, decode, lifecycle\nand hostile-input receipts
Native -> Metrics: Import AppContainer and sandbox receipts
PureGo -> Metrics: Import CGo-free decode, seek, ring\nand race receipts
Harness -> Metrics: Import deterministic range/cache fault proof

Metrics -> Metrics: Verify source SHA-256 and raw failure pointers
Metrics -> Metrics: Expand Windows-Windows, Windows-macOS\nand macOS-macOS without score averaging

alt One complete combination passes every hard gate
  Metrics --> Researcher: Permit production selection
else Any format/gate/pairing fails or is not run
  Metrics --> Researcher: Reject production selection\nwith exact blockers
  Metrics -> Manual: Route physical 30-sample and two-hour rows
end

Metrics --> Researcher: Reproducible fail-closed matrix for ADR
@enduml
